<h3 class="mt-8 text-base font-semibold tracking-tight">Integrations</h3>
<p class="doc-note">Connector cards link to setup routes; search is a GET form, so a query is a shareable URL. Brand marks are flat tiles — Lucide has no brand glyphs.</p>
